          "text": "alphabet = sorted('0123456789QWERTYUIOPASDFGHJKLZXCVBNM')\nfor x in alphabet[:21]:\n    if all(\n            (int(f'32{y}{x}A', 21) + int(f'16{y}18', 21)) % 12 == 0\n            for y in alphabet[1:21:2]\n           ):\n        print((int(f'32{7}{x}A', 21) + int(f'16{7}18', 21)) // 12)\n        break"
